#Протокол_Role_Chain_Handoff_V1<[
Базис:
  WorkItems несут work.owner_role и work.department; agent worker input должен явно передавать role profile без скрытого prompt state.
  Старый ioHasC использует skills и multi-model roles; rebuild начинает с deterministic role→policy mapping.
Вектор:
  role_chain.handoff.v1:
  product_architect → planning-heavy, read snapshot, no file write
  feature_engineer → targetFiles write + verification shell allowlist
  domain_architect → OneBase domain tools deferred; static verify + artifact refs
  agent_platform_architect → runtime/audit tools, dry-run default
  qa_automation → verify/record only, no claim without explicit task
  frontend_architect → UI targetFiles bounded, no network
  Worker Input providerHints.roleProfile и policy.mode derived from owner_role.
Цель:
  Tasks переходят между roles с predictable toolPolicy без manual prompt edits.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: role-chain-handoff-v1
  work.source: design-role-chain-handoff
  trace.status: verified
]>
